step Twisted Evils
  zone map 1443
  tip 15 Theradric Crystal Carvings drop from most Maraudon mobs, so you'll finish it on a normal run. · Fastest: the Nameless Prophet (a centaur ghost) always drops one and respawns quickly, and the group of imps just inside the purple entrance drops plenty. · Willow, who takes it, is in Kormek's Hut north-east of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace. · ~5,250 XP.
  complete 7028 "Twisted Evils" @30.4,60.2
  turnin 7028 "Twisted Evils" @62.2,39.6

step Vyletongue Corruption
  zone map 1443
  tip Two parts. · OUTSIDE the instance, take the orange (right-hand) path in the Maraudon cave. · Use the Coated Cerulean Vial at any pool with orange crystals to get a Filled Cerulean Vial. · INSIDE the orange side, stand within 10 yards of a corrupted Vylestem Vine and use the filled vial. 1-3 Noxxious Scions pop out. · Kill them to heal the vine, and repeat until 8 vines are healed. · Turn in to Talendria at Nijel's Point.
  complete 7041 "Vyletongue Corruption"
  turnin 7041 "Vyletongue Corruption" @68.5,8.9

step The Pariah's Instructions
  zone map 1443
  tip Read the Pariah's Instructions. ~5,450 XP.
  complete 7067 "The Pariah's Instructions"
  turnin 7067 "The Pariah's Instructions" @50.4,86.7

step Legends of Maraudon
  zone map 1443
  tip Cavindra (a dryad in a pool in the orange part of the outer cave) gives this. · Noxxion (orange side) drops the Celebrian Rod, and Lord Vyletongue (purple side) drops the Celebrian Diamond. · Then find Celebras the Cursed on the bridge between the orange and purple areas. · You have to KILL him first: his ghost, Celebras the Redeemed, stays behind. · Talk to the ghost to finish it. · ~3,400 XP.
  complete 7044 "Legends of Maraudon"
  turnin 7044 "Legends of Maraudon"

step Corruption of Earth and Seed
  zone map 1443
  tip Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace. ~6,100 XP.
  complete 7065 "Corruption of Earth and Seed"
  turnin 7065 "Corruption of Earth and Seed" @63.8,10.7

step Legacy runs
  zone map 1445
  tip Range 46-55. · Kill Princess Theradras. · Range 48-53. · Already done it at Stop 22? Tick this off.
  task "Legacy: Maraudon" optional
  task "Legacy: Alcaz Island Prison" optional

